## DSP formulations

The DSP math in the engine (interpolation kernels, biquad/EQ coefficient forms,
window functions, distance/cone models, the non-cryptographic checksum) uses
standard, publicly documented formulations with no proprietary origin. These
are algorithms, not third-party code, so there is no license text to reproduce.
